WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Mooring. Your Macs, within reach. Native remote desktop for Mac.
Free and open source. An early preview.

00:02.000 --> 00:05.000
Before: the remote desktop stops below the MacBook camera notch.

00:05.000 --> 00:14.000
After: the remote Mac's menu bar moves up beside the notch.
Its icons move to make room for the camera.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
The pointer opens remote menus on either side of the notch.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
The Share this Mac window shows a connected, encrypted session,
Stop sharing, automatic sharing, and shared clipboard controls.
This is an earlier preview UI. Current pairing also supports a six-character PIN.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
Download the free, open-source preview at kcirtapfromspace.github.io/mooring.
Apple silicon. macOS 14 or later. Signed and notarized.
